# This repo is developed on both macOS and Windows. Windows checkouts run with
# core.autocrlf=true, which lands CRLF in the working tree even though every
# blob in the repository is already LF — and `gofmt -l .` then lists all 53 Go
# files on nothing but line endings, which buries real formatting drift in
# noise nobody reads. This file makes the checkout match the blobs.
*               text=auto eol=lf

# Left alone deliberately: text=auto already detects these, but Anton drives
# the caption measurement tests and clip.mp4 drives the webhook tests, so a
# newline rewrite here would surface as a baffling test failure rather than an
# obvious corruption.
*.ttf           binary
*.png           binary
*.ico           binary
*.mp4           binary
